                       ISPARTYLOCATION,
                       SALESORDERTNO,
                       JOBORDERTNO,
                       FREIGHTTYPECODE,
                       FREIGHTRATE,
                       FREIGHTADVANCE,
                       VEHICLENO,
                       DRIVERMOBILENO,
                       EWAYBILLNO,
                       CREATOR,
                       CREATIONTIME,
                       freightunitcode,
                       ewaybilldate,
                       vehicletype,
                       salesgrntno,
                       DRIVERNAME,
                       ISSUEDBYEMPLOYEECODE,
                       SODELIVERYADDRESS,
                       JODELIVERYADDRESS,
                       freightchargedat,
                       outwardfratno
                  from LOADINGADVICE
                ```
        }
